<title>USA: Insilco CFO James Miller resigns.</title>
<headline>Insilco CFO James Miller resigns.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insilco Corp said Friday that James Miller, its chief financial officer, has resigned to pursue other business opportunities, effective April 18.</p>
<p>The company said Treasurer David Kauer will take over financial planning and analysis, and that Controller Philip Woodlief will take over responsibility for corporate tax and internal audit.</p>
<p>The company said it does not intend to seek a successor for Miller.</p>
